# Recorded takes, extracted stills and rendered audio: outputs, not source.
# They are large, they are regenerable, and a take can carry whatever your app
# had on screen when it was filmed — keep them out of a public history.
.takes/
.audio/
# Generated footage (the `footage` piece's rendered shots): large, regenerable
# from each shot's provenance sidecar, and possibly filmed off a real screen.
.footage/
# The footage test suite's scratch trailers.
trailers/__test-*

